    <string name="accessibility_consent_message">"To enable hands-free control, MYRA requires Accessibility permission. This allows the app to:

• "<b>Read the content on your screen</b>" to understand context.

• "<b>Perform actions for you</b>" like tapping, scrolling, and navigating.

MYRA is designed to assist, especially visually impaired users, by enabling full voice control of the device.

Do you want to proceed to Settings to enable this?"</string>
    <string name="accessibility_consent_message_v2">"MYRA requires accessibility services to function as your AI assistant.

This enables voice-controlled automation of your device for hands-free operation and improved accessibility.

🔒 All data processing occurs locally on your device for maximum privacy."</string>
    <string name="accessibility_consent_title">🤖 Accessibility Services Required</string>
    <string name="accessibility_permission_desc">🤖 Enable MYRA AI to control your phone through voice commands. This permission allows reading screen content and performing actions for hands-free device automation and improved accessibility.</string>
    <string name="accessibility_permission_details"> <b>🤖 Why MYRA Needs Accessibility Services:</b>"

    MYRA is an AI assistant that helps you control your phone through voice commands. To do this, it requires accessibility permissions to understand and interact with your device.


    "<b>📱 What This Permission Allows:</b>"

    "<b>• Read Screen Content:</b>" MYRA can see and analyze what's currently displayed on your screen to understand the context and provide relevant assistance.


    "<b>• Perform Actions:</b>" Execute touch gestures, taps, swipes, and navigation (Back, Home, Recent Apps) on your behalf based on your voice commands.


    "<b>• App Interaction:</b>" Open apps, fill forms, scroll through content, and navigate between different screens as requested.


    "<b>🔒 Privacy &amp; Data Protection:</b>"

    • All processing happens on Gemini API

    • No personal data is collected or but it is sent to Google Gemini

    • Screen content is only accessed when you actively use MYRA, otherwise MYRA doesnt access screen content

    • We implement safeguards to protect sensitive information, but MYRA can still make mistake


    "<b>♿ Accessibility Benefits:</b>"

    This service enables hands-free device control, making smartphones more accessible for users with disabilities, visual impairments, or mobility limitations.


    "<b>By proceeding, you understand and consent to MYRA using accessibility services for AI-powered device automation.</b>"
    "</string>
    <string name="accessibility_permission_full_desc">"🤖 MYRA is an AI assistant that needs accessibility services to control your phone through voice commands.

This permission allows MYRA to:

• Read screen content to understand context
• Perform touches, swipes, and navigation
• Automate tasks across all apps

🔒 Your privacy is Google Privacy Rule for Gemini API - Your app calls Gemini API to understand his next action."</string>
    <string name="accessibility_permission_needed_for_task">Hey, accessibility permission is needed to execute any task. If you have any concerns about safety or how I work, you can reach out to my developer, Vikash (codeninjavik).</string>
    <string name="accessibility_permission_title">Accessibility Service</string>
    <string name="accessibility_service_description">MYRA AI Assistant uses accessibility services to provide voice-controlled device automation. This allows hands-free operation of your phone through AI-powered commands, making technology more accessible. The service reads screen content and performs actions only when actively requested by you.</string>
