    <string name="battery_optimization_message">"If MYRA is not working properly, this might be due to intense battery optimization by your device manufacturer.

Manufacturers like Samsung, Huawei, OnePlus, Xiaomi, and others often add aggressive battery optimizations that can break MYRA's functionality.

To fix this, you need to disable battery optimizations specifically for MYRA in your device settings."</string>
